  "description": "Electric Mini Bike – Fat Tire Super Fun\nThe DJ Super Bike – our retro-style electric mini bike is back and more super than ever. This redesigned electric mini bike from DJ Bikes Canada now includes the back rack super bike enthusiasts have been asking for. This fat tire electric bike was created for super fun whether you’re on and off road. Perfectly balanced for both comfort and adventure. This easy rider sports a banana-style, cushioned seat, adjustable handlebars and suspension to absorb shocks to keep you comfortable in most riding conditions. Plus enjoy 20” fat tires wrapped around alloy spokeless wheels for strength and stability that begs for an off-road adventure. Use muscle power, 5 levels of peddle assist that puts the power right into your pedal stroke or simply throttle the 500W of power on demand.\nThe DJ Super Bike is loaded with accessories included in the base price that makes it the best value for an electric mini bike. Now you can enjoy the new rear rack, integrated headlight and tail light, front and rear fenders, and a powerful 48V Samsung battery that can be dismounted and charged anywhere on the go. The charger has a safety design to prevent over-charged.",
